-- title:
--   Gluing three congruent automorphisms over a triple fibre product
-- statement:
--   Let $B$, $B_1$, $B'$, $M$, $N$ be commutative rings in one universe, with algebra maps making $B_1$ a $B$- and $B'$-algebra, $B'$ and $M$ algebras over $B$, and $N$ an algebra over $B'$, over $M$ and over $B$, the towers $B \to B' \to N$ and $B \to M \to N$ being compatible, such that $N$ is the pushout of $B \to B'$ along $B \to M$ (i.e. $N \cong M \otimes_B B'$ as registered by `Algebra.IsPushout B B' M N`), and suppose $M$ is flat as a $B$-module. Assume: $B \to B_1$ is surjective; three $B$-algebra maps $p_0,p_1,p_2 \colon B' \to B$ are given, each lying over the structure map $B' \to B_1$ (so $B \to B_1$ applied to $p_i(x)$ is the image of $x$ in $B_1$), jointly injective, and jointly surjective onto triples in $B^3$ with a common image in $B_1$; three $B$-algebra maps $e_0,e_1,e_2 \colon N \to M$ are given which are sections of $M \to N$ and which restrict on $B'$ to $p_i$ followed by $B \to M$; and $t_0,t_1,t_2$ are $B$-algebra automorphisms of $M$ with $t_i(m) - m$ in the ideal $J$ of $M$ generated by the image of $\ker(B \to B_1)$, for all $m$. Then there is a $B'$-algebra automorphism $\sigma$ of $N$ such that $e_i(\sigma n) = t_i(e_i n)$ for all $i$ and $n$; such that $\sigma n - n$ lies, for every $n$, in the ideal of $N$ generated by the image of $\ker(B' \to B_1)$; and such that every $B'$-algebra endomorphism $\sigma'$ of $N$ satisfying the same slice identities $e_i \circ \sigma' = t_i \circ e_i$ equals $\sigma$ pointwise.
--
--   This is the automorphism-gluing step for an algebra obtained by flat base change along a triple fibre product presentation of $B'$: three automorphisms of $M$, each congruent to the identity modulo the ideal cut out by $B \to B_1$, glue uniquely to an automorphism of $N$ over $B'$. It is used in the construction of overlap isomorphisms compatible with the slices in the deformation-theoretic input to the argument, via [`GoodReductionJacobian.BareDeformation.exists_overlap_isos_comap_slice`](thm.html#GoodReductionJacobian.BareDeformation.exists_overlap_isos_comap_slice).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_Algebra_IsPushout_exists_algEquiv_slice_eq_of_flat.lean

